s by HTTP response code\" (bar chart, count by `response.keyword`).\n3. **Alert rule created and enabled** — \"LOC-a02c8bdd 5xx errors\" (`69157ea9-2013-4df1-87ce-789ec35b4a33`), an `.es-query` rule on `kibana_sample_data_logs` matching 5xx response codes (`500`–`509`), threshold `> 10` hits within a 5-minute window, checked every minute; enabled (`enabled: true`).\n\nTIME_FIELD: timestamp"}], "stats": {"input_tokens": 8205, "total_output_tokens": 1609, "reasoning_output_tokens": 722, "tokens_per_second": 26.71605625103191, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.928868}, "response_id": "resp_a1b68e875ff55ce5c326af862e6756d0964b61c49cb8781f"}}}
